  "name": {
   "zh": "运动向量 · WAFT",
   "en": "Motion Vectors · WAFT"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "WAFT 是简单有效的光流方法，和 RAFT 相似，但把代价体换成高分辨率的扭曲，精度更好、显存更省，在 Spring、Sintel、KITTI 上都排第一。这张卡交付 Nuke 能读的多层 EXR：运动向量、置信度和遮挡。",
   "en": "WAFT is a simple, effective optical flow method similar to RAFT, but it replaces the cost volume with high-resolution warping, giving better accuracy with less GPU memory, and ranks first on Spring, Sintel and KITTI. This card delivers a multi-layer EXR that Nuke reads: motion vectors, confidence and occlusion."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-20T10:00:00",
